eviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Moses","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Moses::Moses::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"Moses"},"text":"So Moses the servant of the LORD died there in the land of Moab, as the LORD had said.","verse":5},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Moses","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[{"anchorIndex":5,"href":"?bref=Deut.34.7","rawReference":"Deut.34.7"}],"ruleId":"Moses::Moses::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"Moses"},"text":"Moses was a hundred and twenty years old when he died, yet his eyes were not weak, and his vitality had not diminished.","verse":7},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Moses","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Moses::Moses::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"Moses"},"text":"The Israelites grieved for Moses in the plains of Moab thirty days, until the time of weeping and mourning for Moses came to an end.","verse":8},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Moses","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Moses::Moses::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"Moses"},"text":"Now Joshua son of Nun was filled with the spirit of wisdom because Moses had laid his hands on him. So the Israelites obeyed him and did as the LORD had commanded Moses.","verse":9},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Moses","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguous_name","originalCitations":[{"anchorIndex":90,"href":"?bref=Deut.34.10","rawReference":"Deut.34.10"}],"ruleId":"Moses::Moses::reviewed_unambiguous_name","sourceHeadwordId":"Moses"},"text":"Since that time, no prophet has risen in Israel like Moses, whom the LORD knew face to face—","verse":10},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"Moses","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_unambiguo